Z||000009||88-DOHC||12-07-2001||04:48 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B>A few thousand for a dash???? Wow. Must look into making a dash some day. A few thousand American is several thousand Australian and I don't know of any dash worth that much.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Me either. Ironicly most of the kitcar interior kits for diablo's and such are only around $600 (when purchased with the kitcar kit). However when they sell them as a single item, they run upto $1000-$1200 (and thats just for the dash, not door panels or anything).  However, I have only really seen one interior kit that I felt was good. The Pirana Interior package.  The others...well, there is a couple decent dashes made (wraparound and euro dash), but they really don't catch my interest nor really address my need/desire for what I want.  Guess, I will just have to break down and make my own interior kit for my car.<P>||||reg||1
